          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            On hardware the Pro 5000 is the most treadmill you can buy for the money: a
            <strong class="text-white">22 by 60-inch deck, 3.75 CHP and decline</strong>, in a
